        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-DANICA-PC\"><b>Laurey Polished Chrome Danica Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Danica Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull features one of the most trendsetting styles in cabinet hardware. The sleek, modern look is ideal for kitchen remodel projects. This Tapered Bow Pull is available in several sizes so it can be used on small cabinet drawers but it will also be able to look proportional on large cabinet doors too. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Danica Polished Chrome Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>LAU-75126:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-75226:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-75326:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>LAU-75426:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-3/4\" (224mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-75626:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11-1/4\" (288mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-75826:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 15-1/2\" (392mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>",
